 Snow Surfers PAL/EURO 60hz+VGA patch
                         by japanese_cake 14/03/2015
____________________________________________________


[+] What is this patch for?
    ~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~

        The European version of Rippin' Riders Snowboarding, renamed Snow Surfers,
        does not offer the VGA output nor a 50/60hz selection screen.
		This patch forces the game to run in 60Hz and adds the VGA support.


[+] NOTE
    ~~~~

        When building an Dreamcast image (CDI/GDI/etc.), make sure the VGA flag is
        set in the boot file (AKA IP.BIN).
        Apply the patch using PPF-O-Matic V3.0 on the 1ST_READ.BIN from the following
        GDI dump:
           - Snow Surfers v1.001 (1999)(Sega)(PAL)[!]

        Or simply use the provided 1ST_READ_PATCHED.BIN.
